{%- comment -%}
QUICK LINKS — universal, icon link band.
Include this once from _layouts/default.html so it appears on every page.

Data source (in priority order):
  1. page.quicklinks       — set this in a page's front matter to override
                              the default set just for that page.
  2. site.data.quicklinks  — the site-wide default (see _data/quicklinks.yml).

To hide this section entirely on a specific page, set `noquicklinks: true`
in that page's front matter.

Each entry needs: title, url, icon
  - icon is a NAME matching one of the inline SVG icons defined below
    (globe, info, tools, leaf, news). Ask Claude to add more if needed.

Icons are Heroicons (24x24 outline, MIT licensed), inlined directly —
no image files needed, styled via currentColor.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% assign qlinks = page.quicklinks | default: site.data.quicklinks %}
{%- if qlinks and page.noquicklinks != true -%}
<section class="quick-links">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="quick-links-row">
      {% for link in qlinks %}
        <a class="quick-links-item" href="{{ link.url | relative_url }}">
          <svg class="quick-links-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ql-{{ link.icon }}"/></svg>
          <span class="quick-links-label">{{ link.title }}</span>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

